<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: These clanmen have been here for a long time. Perhaps their ancestors crashed here a thousand years ago, as their legends suggest. In any case, the nordmen are fierce people who live off of the work of others, and they are not afraid to use force to take what's not theirs.\n\nAlbeit not as technologically advanced as other factions, the nordmen can be a valuable ally and a terrible enemy due to their hardiness and savage, heathen ways.\n\nThis particular clan is more progressive than others, and is more likely to engage in trade and diplomacy with other factions.-->
  <VFEM2_CivilClan.description>这些族人已经在这里呆了很长时间了。也许正如他们的传说所暗示的那样，他们的祖先在一千年前坠毁在这里。无论如何，诺德人都是靠别人的劳动为生的凶猛民族，他们并不害怕使用武力夺取不属于他们的东西。

虽然技术上不像其他派别那么先进，但由于他们的坚韧和野蛮、异教的方式，诺德人可以成为宝贵的盟友和可怕的敌人。

这个特殊的群体氏族比其他氏族更进步，更有可能与其他派系进行贸易和外交。</VFEM2_CivilClan.description>
  <!--EN: civil clan-->
  <VFEM2_CivilClan.label>民间氏族</VFEM2_CivilClan.label>
  <!--EN: These clanmen have been here for a long time. Perhaps their ancestors crashed here a thousand years ago, as their legends suggest. In any case, the nordmen are fierce people who live off of the work of others, and they are not afraid to use force to take what's not theirs.\n\nAlbeit not as technologically advanced as other factions, the nordmen can be a valuable ally and a terrible enemy due to their hardiness and savage, heathen ways.\n\nThis particular clan values warlike dominance; it may be difficult to turn them into an ally.-->
  <VFEM2_ClanRough.description>这些族人已经在这里呆了很长时间了。也许正如他们的传说所暗示的那样，他们的祖先在一千年前坠毁在这里。无论如何，诺德人都是靠别人的劳动为生的凶猛民族，他们并不害怕使用武力夺取不属于他们的东西。

虽然技术上不像其他派别那么先进，但由于他们的坚韧和野蛮、异教的方式，诺德人可以成为宝贵的盟友和可怕的敌人。

这个特殊的群体氏族重视好战的统治地位；将他们变成盟友可能很困难。</VFEM2_ClanRough.description>
  <!--EN: rough clan-->
  <VFEM2_ClanRough.label>粗暴族</VFEM2_ClanRough.label>
  <!--EN: These clanmen have been here for a long time. Perhaps their ancestors crashed here a thousand years ago, as their legends suggest. In any case, the nordmen are fierce people who live off of the work of others, and they are not afraid to use force to take what's not theirs.\n\nAlbeit not as technologically advanced as other factions, the nordmen can be a valuable ally and a terrible enemy due to their hardiness and savage, heathen ways.\n\nThis particular clan wreaks havoc in surrounding settlements and takes any survivors into slavery - it will be impossible to become their ally!-->
  <VFEM2_ClanSavage.description>这些族人已经在这里呆了很长时间了。也许正如他们的传说所暗示的那样，他们的祖先在一千年前坠毁在这里。无论如何，诺德人都是靠别人的劳动为生的凶猛民族，他们并不害怕使用武力夺取不属于他们的东西。

虽然技术上不像其他派别那么先进，但由于他们的坚韧和野蛮、异教的方式，诺德人可以成为宝贵的盟友和可怕的敌人。

这个特殊的群体氏族对周围的定居点造成严重破坏，并将任何幸存者变成奴隶——不可能成为他们的盟友！</VFEM2_ClanSavage.description>
  <!--EN: savage clan-->
  <VFEM2_ClanSavage.label>野蛮部落</VFEM2_ClanSavage.label>
  <!--EN: These people have been here for a shorter period of time than their neolithic bretheren. It is believed that some tribespeople and outlanders had come to embrace the medieval ways of life and decided to unite.\n\nThough still technologically inferior to many other factions, the subjects of this kingdom are well-known for using towering fortifications to protect their assets, as well as adopting the use of shields in combat and fighting in a particularly orderly manner.\n\nThis particular kingdom is open to keeping trade relations good with other settlements to bolster their economic position.-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomCivil.description>这些人在这里的时间比他们的新石器时代的同胞要短。据信，一些部落居民和外地人已经接受了中世纪的生活方式，并决定联合起来。

尽管在技术上仍然落后于许多其他派系，但这个王国的臣民以使用高耸的防御工事来保护他们的资产、在战斗中使用盾牌以及以特别有序的方式使用盾牌而闻名。 

这个特定的王国愿意与其他定居点保持良好的贸易关系，以增强其经济地位。</VFEM2_KingdomCivil.description>
  <!--EN: civil kingdom-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomCivil.label>公民王国</VFEM2_KingdomCivil.label>
  <!--EN: These people have been here for a shorter period of time than their neolithic bretheren. It is believed that some tribespeople and outlanders had come to embrace the medieval ways of life and decided to unite.\n\nThough still technologically inferior to many other factions, the subjects of this kingdom are well-known for using towering fortifications to protect their assets, as well as adopting the use of shields in combat and fighting in a particularly orderly manner.\n\nThis particular kingdom is ruled under a heavy hand and wishes to expand by laying the less fortunate to waste - though it is still possible to befriend them.-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomRough.description>这些人在这里的时间比他们的新石器时代的同胞要短。据信，一些部落居民和外地人已经接受了中世纪的生活方式，并决定联合起来。

尽管在技术上仍然落后于许多其他派系，但这个王国的臣民以使用高耸的防御工事来保护他们的资产、在战斗中使用盾牌以及以特别有序的方式使用盾牌而闻名。 

这个特殊的王国受到严厉的统治，并希望通过浪费那些不幸的人来扩张——尽管仍然有可能与他们成为朋友。</VFEM2_KingdomRough.description>
  <!--EN: rough kingdom-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomRough.label>粗糙的王国</VFEM2_KingdomRough.label>
  <!--EN: These people have been here for a shorter period of time than their neolithic bretheren. It is believed that some tribespeople and outlanders had come to embrace the medieval ways of life and decided to unite.\n\nThough still technologically inferior to many other factions, the subjects of this kingdom are well-known for using towering fortifications to protect their assets, as well as adopting the use of shields in combat and fighting in a particularly orderly manner.\n\nThis particular kingdom is driven by a warband styled culture; you will not be able to ally with them!-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomSavage.description>这些人在这里的时间比他们的新石器时代的同胞要短。据信，一些部落居民和外地人已经接受了中世纪的生活方式，并决定联合起来。

尽管在技术上仍然落后于许多其他派系，但这个王国的臣民以使用高耸的防御工事来保护他们的资产、在战斗中使用盾牌以及以特别有序的方式使用盾牌而闻名。 

这个特殊的王国是由战帮风格的文化驱动的；你将无法与他们结盟！</VFEM2_KingdomSavage.description>
  <!--EN: savage kingdom-->
  <VFEM2_KingdomSavage.label>野蛮王国</VFEM2_KingdomSavage.label>
  <!--EN: These people have been here for a shorter period of time than their neolithic brethren. These wandering traders and skilled negotiators form a vast network of traveling caravans and temporary markets. Originating from a loose coalition of outlanders and former city-dwellers, they abandoned static settlements in favor of constant movement, seeking prosperity through commerce rather than conquest.\n\nUnlike most factions, the Guild operates on a pure barter economy—silver holds no value to them, only goods and services do. Their traders travel far and wide, setting up bustling market hubs wherever they stop, offering rare wares and exotic goods in exchange for what they deem useful.\n\nThough they avoid direct conflict and prefer diplomacy, their well-armed guards ensure that their caravans remain safe from opportunistic raiders.-->
  <VFEM2_MerchantGuild.description>这些人在这里生活的时间比他们的新石器时代的同胞要短。这些流浪商人和熟练的谈判者形成了一个由旅行商队和临时市场组成的庞大网络。他们起源于外地人和前城市居民的松散联盟，放弃了静态定居点，转而不断迁徙，通过商业而不是征服来寻求繁荣。

与大多数派系不同，公会以纯粹的易货经济运作——白银对他们来说没有价值，只有商品和服务有价值。他们的商人云游四方，在他们停靠的任何地方建立熙熙攘攘的市场中心，提供稀有商品和异国情调的商品来换取他们认为有用的东西。

虽然他们避免直接冲突并更喜欢外交，但他们装备精良的守卫确保他们的商队免受机会主义袭击者的侵害。</VFEM2_MerchantGuild.description>
  <!--EN: merchant's guild-->
  <VFEM2_MerchantGuild.label>商人行会</VFEM2_MerchantGuild.label>
